 "remarks": "One block from New Canaan's fine restaurants, shops and train. Spacious 3 bedroom, 2.5 bath townhouse in professionally maintained complex of 8 units. Rare first floor primary. Unit was renovated in August of 2025. Hardwood floors throughout the EIK, dining room and Living room. LR has a wood burning fireplace, and slider to flagstone patio. Primary bedroom is on the first floor with its own bath. Second floor has two bedrooms that share a hall bath and a rec/den room.  Tenant pays rent, utilities and $500 sewer. Credit of 720+, credit check, first month's rent and two month's security deposit. Professional landlord maintains the exterior, landscaping, snow removal. No pets per HOA. Available 8/15/2026. No Co-Signers or Guarantors allowed. 500k Limited liability ins. required. Addendum to lease required.",
